Package: descriptiveStats
Title: Descriptive Statistics with Careful Edge-Case Handling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Rahiq", "Raees", , "rahiqraees10@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides six descriptive statistics helpers (mean, median,
    mode, first and third quartiles, interquartile range) that validate
    their inputs and document their behaviour for empty vectors, missing
    values, ties and single observations.
